{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09574","headline":"梁州对雨怀麴二秀才便呈麴大判官时疾赠余新诗 · 岑参","name":"梁州对雨怀麴二秀才便呈麴大判官时疾赠余新诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上云气黑，𡷛山昨夜雷\n水恶平明飞，雨从嶓冢来。\n蒙蒙随风过，萧飒鸣庭槐。\n隔帘湿衣巾，当暑凉幽斋。\n麴生住相近，言语阻且乖。\n卧疾不见人，午时门始开。\n终日看本草，药苗满前堦。\n兄弟早有名，甲科皆秀才。\n二人事慈母，不弱古老莱。\n昨叹携手迟，未尽平生怀。\n爱君有佳句，一日吟几回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}